      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIVOLI (8) comes through the Vicbred Super Series where she was fifth in her heat before working and fading out of the final. Had gone into that series off a placing at this circuit and distance. Draws for a trail and will enjoy a class drop. FROSTY DROP (1) gave a good sight here last time, leading from this barrier and sticking on for fourth, beaten 4.5 metres. She can be in this for a long way. BLACKINDEED (7) is first up for five-and-a-half months but is a two-time winner at this circuit and distance and was readied with two trials so can open this campaign with a positive effort. TRYX VIXEN (3) draws well and is another better placed coming off the Vicbred series.",
